      "widgets_values": [
        "You are an image captioning model. Describe only what is visibly present in the image.\n\nRules:\n1. Describe subjects, clothing, colors, materials, textures, and their spatial relationships.\n2. Include composition, framing, camera angle, lighting, and background.\n3. State only what you can see. Do not infer mood, story, intent, or anything outside the frame.\n4. Do not add stylistic flourishes, quality tags, or words like \"beautiful\" or \"stunning\".\n5. Write one cohesive paragraph. No bullets, no JSON, no markdown, no preamble.\n\nWrite a detailed description of this image.\n"
      ]
    },
