      "widgets_values": [
        "The image shows two women standing on a balcony with a metal railing, positioned in the foreground. The woman on the left has red hair with bangs, is wearing a black triangle bikini top and matching bottoms with tied side ties, and is holding a camera to take a selfie. The woman on the right has dark hair with pink highlights styled in two braids, wears a green short-sleeved button-up shirt with small white dots and pink cuffs, and has a low neckline. Behind them, the Eiffel Tower is visible in the distance, centered in the background under a sky transitioning from orange and pink near the horizon to blue above, with scattered clouds. Below the tower, there are green trees, roads, and some distant buildings. The lighting suggests sunset or sunrise, casting warm tones across the scene. The composition is a selfie shot with the subjects occupying the lower half of the frame, while the Eiffel Tower dominates the upper portion of the image."
      ]
    },
